where he started.

171
00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:22.896
You would do that?

172
00:09:24.147 --> 00:09:25.607
Which is it?

173
00:09:30.821 --> 00:09:32.197
You got it?

174
00:09:32.281 --> 00:09:33.156
Yeah. Fine.

175
00:09:37.828 --> 00:09:39.162
You got a lotta tattoos there.

176
00:09:39.246 --> 00:09:40.747
Yeah.

177
00:09:41.915 --> 00:09:44.167
