of our confidential informants

196
00:10:25.208 --> 00:10:26.793
and he's been talkin' to me.

197
00:10:26.877 --> 00:10:28.295
No way he'd buy
Breen would talk.

198
00:10:28.378 --> 00:10:30.672
Maybe yes. maybe no...

199
00:10:30.756 --> 00:10:33.300
so plant that seed with care.

200
00:10:33.383 --> 00:10:35.635
