240
00:12:29.499 --> 00:12:31.084
Lock up when you're done.

241
00:12:31.168 --> 00:12:32.252
All right. thank you.

242
00:12:32.335 --> 00:12:34.087
Yeah. thanks. Seamus.

243
00:12:34.171 --> 00:12:35.422
Hey. Seamus.
it's as hot as balls.

244
00:12:35.505 --> 00:12:36.882
You got any cold beers?

245
00:12:36.965 --> 00:12:38.216
In the ice chest.

246
00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.926
-You're a fuckin' hero.
-Yeah. yeah.

247
00:12:43.513 --> 00:12:46.141
This Leon guy. he all right?

248
00:12:46.224 --> 00:12:47.392
